00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:28.890
Oh, shoot...

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.530
Hi there!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.550
Oh! Go for it!

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:46.310
Don't get beaten up, Big Sister!
Oh! Go for it!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:46.380
Way to go!
Don't get beaten up, Big Sister!

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.250
Way to go!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.810
Ushiko! Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?
Way to go!

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:50.890
Way to go!

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:55.360
Oh, Umao! Wherefore art thou, Umao?

