00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.570
DIE!

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:58.310
Yeah, I did it!

00:19:58.310 --> 00:19:59.400
Cool!
Yeah, I did it!

00:19:59.400 --> 00:19:59.510
That's it!
Cool!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:19:59.640
That's it!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:01.510
FIGHT!
That's it!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:05.280
Oh, my! My girls!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.590
That new girl... Kinda light-weight, eh?

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:11.590
Yes... What a great find she is!

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:12.050
Uh-huh!

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:14.250
I mean, she won't even let the opponent touch her!

00:20:14.620 --> 00:20:18.460
K...Kurumi! Manami!
Get out of the ring RIGHT NOW!

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:26.210
Busted! Busted!

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:26.500
Who the heck are you?!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:29.770
Oh! Er... Oh! I... er...

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:29.840
Huh?!
Oh! Er... Oh! I... er...

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:30.940
Huh?!

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.700
Er... I'm the legal guardian of those two! Yes, ma'am...

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:40.140
Now, now... here you go... Please, sir!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.930
Oh! Why, thank you very much...

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.620
Thank you for inviting me...

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:46.880
But, it's just too bad!
Thank you for inviting me...

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:47.280
Huh?
But, it's just too bad!

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:47.360
Huh?

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:51.650
That pro wrestler lady really had
an interest in Kurumi and Manami!

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.090
Really? Say, Papa, are you still opposed to us doing it?

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:57.770
I said NO, and I meant it!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.880
He told you guys not to use the Power, didn't he?

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.680
Dad was in shock, you know!

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:06.330
Aww! Kurumi wanted to become a star as quickly as possible!

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:12.320
Oh, no! Are you all right, Darling?

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.380
Yeah...

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.260
Well, then... next, we have...

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.520
...me, Hiyama Hikaru!
Allow me to be an idol star for a moment!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:40.980
Oh, my love will ride the southern wind.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:50.010
Oh, the Blue Wind... come hither, then go run onto the island...

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.660
In the end...

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.970
...my dream had nothing to do with anything.

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:10.210
The two were able to get reunited at the banks of the Milky Way...

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:11.280
Still...

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:13.820
"You're the worst!"

00:22:13.820 --> 00:22:17.480
What did... What did that mean...?

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:20.960
Are you still in pain?

00:22:20.960 --> 00:22:23.650
Oh! I'm all right.

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:25.720
Oh...

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:30.080
I'm glad.

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:34.230
I... forgot to make a wish.

00:22:35.230 --> 00:22:38.280
Oh! No, you can't look!

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:41.880
What's wrong with that?!
What's wrong with looking at it?

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:46.420
No can do. Why not leave it...?

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:51.710
Anyway... no need, 'cause... It's best the way it is now.

00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:56.410
A...Ayukawa...

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:03.700
When something is said to be the "best,"
it means, basically...

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:07.440
...the complete opposite of when
something is said to be the "worst."

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:09.690
So, it must mean that...

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:22.550
I found this out much later, but it seems that...

00:23:22.550 --> 00:23:24.450
...because I was sleeping upside down...

00:23:24.450 --> 00:23:29.350
...my foreboding dream played out
exactly backwards.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:24:02.860
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:10.430
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.430 --> 00:24:25.780
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.780 --> 00:24:38.390
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.390 --> 00:24:48.600
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.600 --> 00:24:55.610
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.610 --> 00:25:07.010
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:13.260 --> 00:25:16.100
Dad's gonna be holding an exhibition soon.

00:25:16.100 --> 00:25:20.100
When I mentioned it to Hikaru,
she lit up, and said she'd help out!

00:25:20.100 --> 00:25:24.770
But, Ayukawa lied, saying that she had to work at ABCB.

00:25:24.770 --> 00:25:29.330
Next time: "Madoka's Ultimate Decision! Putting a Period to the Love Triangle"
